  ],
  "derivation": "A columns40 and0 with10px gap span50. B inherits them with3px inline padding: local final-track start47 and end44 are distinct although its floored breadth is0. C inherits B in RTL. Reflection around extent44 maps the actual final-track end44 to logical start0, not -3 from reflecting floored breadth. C border box is44 at x3. Its20px first-column start-aligned child therefore ends at physical47 and starts27; its full-span child stays44 at x3.",
